/-!
# Stabilizers and perfect-residual actions at Mathieu cocode pairs

Every native M24 weight-two vector has its actual stabilizer isomorphic
to MulAut M22 by conjugation on the pointwise pair stabilizer. For both M24
and M23, the weight-two stabilizers and their actual perfect residuals
generate the whole eleven-dimensional cocode by displacements. The proofs
use native M22 transitivity, Golay minimum distance and code--cocode duality.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith, H.15.1(1)--(2), printed p.398, and the
perfect-residual use in 8.1.1, printed p.712.
-/
